      "title": "Main Hall: Entryway",
      "html": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Main_Hall:_Entryway\">Main Hall: Entryway</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Skyrim:Main_Hall&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Main Hall: Entryway\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A number of miscellaneous items are added with various furnishing options, but only notable items are specified on this table—specifically, usable <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Containers\" title=\"Skyrim:Containers\">containers</a>. Though other common items and ingredients are added to your home, they are not listed here. Note that the icon displayed for each furnishing option does not necessarily represent what is actually built in your home. \n</p><p>Note that the End Table option will no longer be available once you've built the Main Hall, and must be added to the entryway while still using the Small House layout. <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Small_House_Layout#Furnishing_Options\" title=\"Skyrim:Small House Layout\">Click here</a> for information on everything else that will happen if you remodel the Small House Layout into an Entryway. See below for additional changes added with the <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim_Mod:Unofficial_Hearthfire_Patch\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim Mod:Unofficial Hearthfire Patch\">Unofficial Hearthfire Patch</a> installed.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"6\">Main Hall, Entryway - Furnishings\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th colspan=\"2\">Options</th>\n<th>Materials</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Containers\n</th>\n<td width=\"48\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/8/87/SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/8/87/SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/8/87/SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Barrels.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Barrels <sup class=\"reference plainlinks nourlexpansion\" id=\"note_House\"><a href=\"#intnote_House\">†</a></sup></td>\n<td>Sawn Log, Nails, Iron Ingot</td>\n<td>One southwest corner with two sacks.<br /> One northeast corner with one sack.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/3/36/SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/3/36/SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/3/36/SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Dresser.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Dresser <sup class=\"reference plainlinks nourlexpansion\" id=\"note_House\"><a href=\"#intnote_House\">†</a></sup></td>\n<td>Sawn Log, 3 Nails, Iron Fittings</td>\n<td>East wall, back.\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-top:solid 2px\">\n<th rowspan=\"4\">Furniture\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Display Case on Low Table.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/1/1d/SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/1/1d/SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/1/1d/SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Display Case on Low Table</td>\n<td>2 Sawn Log, 4 Nails, Hinge, Glass</td>\n<td>East wall, center. End Table with small Display Case and Strongbox.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table_01.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Display Case on Low Table 01.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/b/ba/SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table_01.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table_01.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/b/ba/SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table_01.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table_01.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/b/ba/SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table_01.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Display_Case_on_Low_Table_01.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Display Case on Low Table</td>\n<td>2 Sawn Log, 4 Nails, Hinge, Glass</td>\n<td>West wall, center. End Table with large Display Case.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Low_Table.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Low Table.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/1/1f/SR-icon-construction-Low_Table.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Low_Table.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/1/1f/SR-icon-construction-Low_Table.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Low_Table.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/1/1f/SR-icon-construction-Low_Table.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Low_Table.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Low Table</td>\n<td>Sawn Log, 2 Nails</td>\n<td>West wall, south side.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Night_Tables.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Night Tables.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Night_Tables.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Night_Tables.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Night_Tables.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Night_Tables.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Night_Tables.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Night_Tables.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Night Tables (2)</td>\n<td>2 Sawn Log, 4 Nails</td>\n<td>One on each side of north wall.\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-top:solid 2px\">\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Weapon Racks\n</th>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Weapon_Racks.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Weapon Racks.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/4/49/SR-icon-construction-Weapon_Racks.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Weapon_Racks.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/4/49/SR-icon-construction-Weapon_Racks.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Weapon_Racks.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/4/49/SR-icon-construction-Weapon_Racks.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Weapon_Racks.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Weapon Racks (2)</td>\n<td>2 Sawn Log, 2 Iron Fittings</td>\n<td>One single rack on each side of end table on east wall.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weapon Racks (2)</td>\n<td>2 Sawn Log, 2 Iron Fittings</td>\n<td>One single rack on each side of end table on west wall.\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-top:solid 2px\">\n<th rowspan=\"2\">Shelves\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Corner_Shelf.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Corner Shelf.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/e/e4/SR-icon-construction-Corner_Shelf.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Corner_Shelf.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/e/e4/SR-icon-construction-Corner_Shelf.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Corner_Shelf.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/e/e4/SR-icon-construction-Corner_Shelf.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Corner_Shelf.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Corner Shelf <sup class=\"reference plainlinks nourlexpansion\" id=\"note_House\"><a href=\"#intnote_House\">†</a></sup></td>\n<td>Sawn Log, 3 Nails</td>\n<td>Southeast corner.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Wall_Shelves.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Wall Shelves.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/4/4c/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Shelves.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Shelves.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/4/4c/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Shelves.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Shelves.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/4/4c/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Shelves.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Shelves.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Wall Shelves (2)</td>\n<td>Sawn Log, Nails</td>\n<td>One on each side of north wall.\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-top:solid 2px\">\n<th>Exterior\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Wall Sconces.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Wall Sconces (2) <sup class=\"reference plainlinks nourlexpansion\" id=\"note_House\"><a href=\"#intnote_House\">†</a></sup></td>\n<td>Iron Fittings, Goat Horns</td>\n<td>One on each side of door.\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-top:solid 2px\">\n<th rowspan=\"8\">Miscellaneous\n</th>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Bear_Head.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Mounted Bear Head.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/3/3f/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Bear_Head.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Bear_Head.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/3/3f/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Bear_Head.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Bear_Head.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/3/3f/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Bear_Head.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Bear_Head.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Mounted Bear Head</td>\n<td>Leather Strips, Bear Pelt</td>\n<td>Back west wall.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Elk_Head.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Mounted Elk Head.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/8/8a/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Elk_Head.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Elk_Head.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/8/8a/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Elk_Head.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Elk_Head.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/8/8a/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Elk_Head.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Elk_Head.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Mounted Elk Head</td>\n<td>Deer Hide, Large Antlers, Leather Strips</td>\n<td>East wall middle, above End Table.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mounted Elk Head</td>\n<td>Deer Hide, Large Antlers, Leather Strips</td>\n<td>West wall middle, above End Table.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Sabre_Cat_Head.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Mounted Sabre Cat Head.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/f/f2/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Sabre_Cat_Head.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Sabre_Cat_Head.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/f/f2/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Sabre_Cat_Head.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Sabre_Cat_Head.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/f/f2/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Sabre_Cat_Head.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Sabre_Cat_Head.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Mounted Sabre Cat Head</td>\n<td>Leather Strips, Sabre Cat Pelt, 2 Sabre Cat Tooth</td>\n<td>East wall, north side.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Snowy_Sabre_Cat_Head.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Mounted Snowy Sabre Cat Head.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/5/58/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Snowy_Sabre_Cat_Head.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Snowy_Sabre_Cat_Head.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/5/58/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Snowy_Sabre_Cat_Head.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Snowy_Sabre_Cat_Head.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/5/58/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Snowy_Sabre_Cat_Head.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Snowy_Sabre_Cat_Head.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Mounted Snowy Sabre Cat Head</td>\n<td>Leather Strips, Sabre Cat Snow Pelt, 2 Sabre Cat Tooth</td>\n<td>West wall, south side.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Wolf_Head.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Mounted Wolf Head.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/f/f8/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Wolf_Head.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Wolf_Head.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/f/f8/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Wolf_Head.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Wolf_Head.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/f/f8/SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Wolf_Head.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Mounted_Wolf_Head.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Mounted Wolf Head</td>\n<td>Leather Strips, Wolf Pelt</td>\n<td>East wall, front.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"SR-icon-construction-Wall Sconces.png\" src=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png/48px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\" srcset=\"//images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png/72px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png 1.5x, //images.uesp.net/thumb/6/6b/SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png/96px-SR-icon-construction-Wall_Sconces.png 2x\" /></a></td>\n<td>Wall Sconces (2)</td>\n<td>Iron Fittings, Goat Horns</td>\n<td>Behind night stands.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Wall Sconces (2) <sup class=\"reference plainlinks nourlexpansion\" id=\"note_House\"><a href=\"#intnote_House\">†</a></sup></td>\n<td>Iron Fittings, Goat Horns</td>\n<td>Front wall, either side of door.\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"border-top:solid 2px\">\n<th>Total Materials:<sup class=\"reference plainlinks nourlexpansion\" id=\"note_UHFPEntryway\"><a href=\"#intnote_UHFPEntryway\">‡</a></sup>\n</th>\n<td colspan=\"4\"><i>1 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Bear_Pelt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Bear Pelt\">Bear Pelt</a>, 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Deer_Hide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Deer Hide\">Deer Hides</a>, 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Glass_(item)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Glass (item)\">Glass</a>, 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Goat_Horns\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Goat Horns\">Goat Horns</a>, 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Hinge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Hinge\">Hinges</a>, 8 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Iron_Fittings\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Iron Fittings\">Iron Fittings</a>, 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Iron_Ingot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Iron Ingot\">Iron Ingot</a>, 2 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Large_Antlers\" title=\"Skyrim:Large Antlers\">Large Antlers</a>, 6 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Leather_Strips\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Leather Strips\">Leather Strips</a>, 22 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Nails\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Nails\">Nails</a>, 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Sabre_Cat_Pelt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Sabre Cat Pelt\">Sabre Cat Pelt</a>, 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Sabre_Cat_Snow_Pelt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Sabre Cat Snow Pelt\">Sabre Cat Snow Pelt</a>, 4 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Sabre_Cat_Tooth\" title=\"Skyrim:Sabre Cat Tooth\">Sabre Cat Teeth</a>, 15 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Sawn_Log\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Sawn Log\">Sawn Logs</a>, 1 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Wolf_Pelt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Wolf Pelt\">Wolf Pelt</a></i><br />(11.2 <a href=\"/wiki/Skyrim:Iron_Ingot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skyrim:Iron Ingot\">Iron Ingots</a> in addition to the 1 already listed)\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div id=\"intnote_House\" class=\"citation\" style=\"display:flow-root; clear: left; position: relative; margin-left: 1.6em; min-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; right: 100%; margin-right: 0.2em; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#note_House\">†</a></span>This option does not appear if you have previously created the item in the Small House Layout, as it is still in place.</div>\n<div id=\"intnote_UHFPEntryway\" class=\"citation\" style=\"display:flow-root; clear: left; position: relative; margin-left: 1.6em; min-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"position: absolute; right: 100%; margin-right: 0.2em; font-weight: bold;\"><a href=\"#note_UHFPEntryway\">‡</a></span>The unofficial patches fix a bench which should have replaced the end table from the small house. This requires one additional sawn log and a nail. In addition, the mounted bear head becomes a mounted cave bear head, requiring the appropriate change in materials.</div>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by content3.uesp.net\nCached time: 20260805230536\nCache expiry: 86400\nDynamic content: false\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1191/1000000\nPreprocessor generated node count: 0/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3574/8388608 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1619/8388608 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/1000\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.428      1 -total\n 61.32%    8.847     16 Template:Icon\n 43.23%    6.238     16 Template:Icon_Abbr\n 12.34%    1.781      2 Template:Note\n 11.69%    1.687      6 Template:ThickLine\n 11.32%    1.633      6 Template:Intnote\n-->\n</div>"
